  <name>Gamma Statechart Composition Framework</name>

  <!--
    Tycho *pomless* build: .mvn/extensions.xml enables tycho-build, which
    derives each module's artifactId, version and packaging from its
    MANIFEST.MF. There are deliberately no per-plugin pom.xml files, so bundle
    versions cannot drift away from Maven versions the way they did before
    (the old poms still said 2.3.1-SNAPSHOT against a 2.13.0 bundle version).

    Generated sources are not in version control - no src-gen or xtend-gen is
    tracked - so a clean checkout must run the MWE2 workflows in
    setup/hu.bme.mit.gamma.setup before this build can compile.
  -->

